      "message": "T44/T45: automatic comparison of the full-note checker with the experts\n\nAgreement of the model-derived full-note reference with the expert labels, and precision/recall of\nthe cited sentences against the expert evidence sentences, with patient-level bootstrap CIs.\nDescriptive and post-hoc; the human checks of the plan (200-rule audit, 50-inference hand check)\nare not done.",
